        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We have been coming to Watersound as a family since 2017. This was by far our favorite home that we have stayed in. The house was spacious and gave everyone plenty of room to spread out. All the bedrooms were beautiful and no one felt that they were getting shorted. The younger of the kids enjoyed the huge bunk room and the teenagers found refuge in the carriage house. We loved our visit so much that we wished we could have extended to stay longer. We would rebook this home again in the future!",
