        "id": "64a8d2a174b2fe6874b6f6b4",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This was our 10th year to WaterSound and definitely one of our best rentals! The house is set up nicely and was very clean upon arrival. The weather didn't fully cooperate the first couple of days, but between the carriage house with the large movie screen, the massive bunk room and the game area with the ping pong table our large group had plenty of space to spread out and stay well entertained. We have a rule that we want to stay in a different house every year, but this house is one we would consider staying in again. The Embark850 team was very responsive and super helpful during our stay. Look forward to renting through them in the future.",
